msgid ""
"The initial published version of this Code of Conduct was adapted from the "
"`Contributor Covenant, version 1.4 <https://contributor-covenant.org/"
"version/1/4>`__ and the `Rust Code of Conduct <https://rust-lang.org/"
"policies/code-of-conduct/>`__."
msgstr ""
